<li>Réveillon da Praia: <a href="https://linktr.ee/dapraiareveillon" rel="noopener">Linktree</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DfaiAZHJCHw/" rel="noopener">line-up</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DfhaGCKRYa3/" rel="noopener">aviso do lote</a> e <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DdMTuJ-xgmj/" rel="noopener">data e horário</a>.</li>
