values (
  'new-years-eve-sao-miguel-do-gostoso-2027-parties-and-tickets',
  'New Year''s Eve in São Miguel do Gostoso 2027: parties and tickets',
  'Four New Year''s Eve parties in São Miguel do Gostoso for the turn of 2027: dates, venues, acts, prices and where to buy the ticket for each one.',
  $vgpost$<p>Four New Year's Eve parties already have public information for the turn of 2026 into 2027 in São Miguel do Gostoso: Amy Gostoso, Aqui Se Faz Gostoso, Réveillon da Praia and Réveillon Solarium. All of them include the night of December 31, 2026, and each has its own ticket, with a different price, start time and format. This guide gathers what each organizer has published, with a link to the source for each party.</p>
<p>Last check on the official pages: 11/10/2026. Ticket batches, prices and acts can change, so the final word is always on each party's profile or sales page. Ticket pages and organizer posts are in Portuguese.</p>

<h2 id="summary">The four parties side by side</h2>
<table class="comparison-table">
<thead><tr><th>Party</th><th>When</th><th>Where</th><th>Music</th><th>Tickets</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Amy Gostoso</td><td>Dec 31, 9 pm to 5:30 am</td><td>Restaurante Coco Gostoso, Praia Morro dos Martins</td><td>DJ Leandro Rallo, house music</td><td>Amy's official site. Open bar and open food</td></tr>
<tr><td>Aqui Se Faz Gostoso</td><td>Dec 31 (9:30 pm), Jan 2 (8 pm) and Jan 3 (4 pm)</td><td>Dune Beach &amp; Ville</td><td>More than 12 acts, including Malive and Dre Guazzelli</td><td>Ingresse. Premium open bar on New Year's Eve night</td></tr>
<tr><td>Réveillon da Praia</td><td>Dec 31, from 10 pm</td><td>Bar da Praia, barefoot on the sand</td><td>Rádio Axé, Dani Cruz, DJ Fornox and DJ Cari</td><td>OutGo or WhatsApp, in batches</td></tr>
<tr><td>Réveillon Solarium</td><td>Dec 31, 9 pm to 2 am</td><td>Pousada Solarium de Gostoso</td><td>Live band and a retro DJ</td><td>Sympla, R$ 360 plus fee. Dinner and fireworks included</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2 id="amy-gostoso">Amy Gostoso: barefoot on the sand, open bar and open food</h2>
<p>Réveillon Amy Gostoso takes place on December 31, from 9 pm to 5:30 am, at Restaurante Coco Gostoso on Praia Morro dos Martins. The organizers describe it as a barefoot party with everything included. DJ Leandro Rallo and guests run the dance floor with house music facing the sea.</p>
<p>The official site lists lobster, octopus, shrimp, picanha steak and seafood paella in the open food, and mentions premium drinks and sparkling wine through the night. There is an optional exclusive shuttle leaving from Rua da Xêpa. The event's own tip is to avoid high heels because of the sand. On Instagram, Amy presents this as its second edition.</p>
<p>Tickets, and questions about tables, VIP areas and the shuttle, are on <a href="https://reveillonamygostoso.com.br" rel="noopener">Amy's official site</a> and the profile <a href="https://www.instagram.com/amy.gostoso/" rel="noopener">@amy.gostoso</a>. The ticket price does not appear on the site's home page, so check it at checkout.</p>

<h2 id="aqui-se-faz-gostoso">Aqui Se Faz Gostoso: three days of parties at Dune Beach &amp; Ville</h2>
<p>Aqui Se Faz Gostoso is the organized New Year's Eve that the destination announced in October. According to the <a href="https://brasilturis.com.br/2026/10/02/sao-miguel-do-gostoso-mira-mercado-nacional-para-reduzir-sazonalidade-durante-a-semana/" rel="nofollow noopener">Brasilturis report of October 2, 2026</a>, it returns after a three-year break, with room for up to a thousand people and partnerships with pousadas, restaurants and beach clubs.</p>
<p>On the Ingresse sales page, the program has three dates at Dune Beach &amp; Ville: December 31 at 9:30 pm, January 2 at 8 pm and January 3 at 4 pm. There are more than 12 acts, including Malive, Dre Guazzelli, Karenzinha, Marcinho, Luke + Álvarez, Kaluna, Daniel Marrom, Galix, Fabi Dall'Onder and Pri Oliveira. New Year's Eve night has a premium open bar. The other two parties sell drinks separately, and the venue has a food area.</p>
<p>Tickets and details for each date are on the <a href="https://www.ingresse.com/reveillon-aqui-se-faz-gostoso" rel="noopener">event page on Ingresse</a> and the profile <a href="https://www.instagram.com/reveillonaquisefazgostoso/" rel="noopener">@reveillonaquisefazgostoso</a>. If you plan to stay all three days, check lodging before buying, because the party runs until January 3.</p>

<h2 id="reveillon-da-praia">Réveillon da Praia: Bar da Praia, from 10 pm</h2>
<p>Réveillon da Praia is held by Bar da Praia, set for December 31 from 10 pm on Rua dos Corais. The line-up announced on November 6 has Rádio Axé, Dani Cruz, DJ Fornox and DJ Cari, and the profile describes the music as a path from jazz to funk, through Brazilian rhythms and house.</p>
<p>Tickets are sold in batches. The last notice we read, from November 9, said the current batch ran until 11/10 or until sold out, with sales through OutGo or the WhatsApp number in the bio link. Since the batch may have changed, confirm the current price on the event's <a href="https://linktr.ee/dapraiareveillon" rel="noopener">Linktree</a> or the profile <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dapraiareveillon/" rel="noopener">@dapraiareveillon</a>, run together with <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bardapraia1/" rel="noopener">@bardapraia1</a>.</p>

<h2 id="reveillon-solarium">Réveillon Solarium: dinner, fireworks and a fixed price</h2>
<p>Pousada Solarium de Gostoso holds Réveillon Solarium, Gostoso de Viver 2027, on December 31 from 9 pm to 2 am, at Rua dos Dourados, 380. The <a href="https://www.sympla.com.br/evento/reveillon-solarium-gostoso-de-viver-2027/3644959" rel="noopener">Sympla page</a> has the most detail: the price is public and so is the dinner menu.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Single ticket:</strong> R$ 360.00 plus a R$ 36.00 fee.</li>
<li><strong>Table for 2:</strong> R$ 820.00 plus a R$ 82.00 fee.</li>
<li><strong>Table for 4:</strong> R$ 1,640.00 plus a R$ 164.00 fee.</li>
<li><strong>Sales until:</strong> 12/29/2026.</li>
<li><strong>Included:</strong> fireworks, New Year's dinner and non-alcoholic drinks (water, juices and soft drinks).</li>
<li><strong>Music:</strong> live band and a DJ with a retro repertoire.</li>
<li><strong>Your own drinks:</strong> cooler allowed and no corkage fee, so you can bring your own.</li>
</ul>
<p>For dinner, the pousada announces octopus rice, lobster in vatapá, filet mignon in demi-glace sauce, gratin shrimp in béchamel and fish in coconut milk, with starters, salads and desserts. Prices read on Sympla in November 2026. The event policy allows cancellation up to 7 days after purchase, as long as the request arrives at least 48 hours before the start. See also the <a href="/negocio/pousada-solarium">Pousada Solarium listing</a> in our directory and the profile <a href="https://www.instagram.com/pousadasolariumdegostoso/" rel="noopener">@pousadasolariumdegostoso</a>.</p>

<h2 id="how-to-choose">How to choose your night</h2>
<div class="callout callout--info">
<p><strong>Want dinner and a fixed price:</strong> Solarium is the only one of the four with price, dinner and cancellation policy public on the sales page.</p>
<p><strong>Want barefoot on the sand with everything included:</strong> Amy announces open bar and open food and starts at 9 pm at Coco Gostoso.</p>
<p><strong>Want more than one night of parties:</strong> Aqui Se Faz Gostoso has three dates, from 12/31 to 01/03.</p>
<p><strong>Want to ring in the year with friends at Bar da Praia:</strong> Réveillon da Praia is the one that starts latest, at 10 pm.</p>
</div>
<p>The parties are in different parts of town and along the coast, and all of them end in the early hours. Pick one, buy through the official channel and plan in advance how you will get back to your pousada.</p>

<h2 id="lodging-transfer-dinner">Lodging, transfer and where to eat before the party</h2>
<p>New Year is the busiest time and lodging in Gostoso is limited. See the options on the page <a href="/fique">where to stay in Gostoso</a> and ask the pousada about minimum nights, the cancellation policy and whether dinner or a party is included. Our earlier guide, <a href="/blog/new-years-eve-sao-miguel-do-gostoso-2026">how to plan New Year's Eve in Gostoso</a>, has the list of questions to ask before booking.</p>
<p>To get here, the most common gateway is Natal airport. Book the <a href="/transfer">transfer</a> together with your lodging, because the earliest and latest times sell out first. If you are driving, find the route in <a href="/blog/how-to-get-to-sao-miguel-do-gostoso">how to get to São Miguel do Gostoso</a>. To build your trip budget, use the post <a href="/blog/how-much-does-it-cost-to-travel-sao-miguel-do-gostoso">how much it costs to travel to Gostoso</a>.</p>
<p>Before the party, check <a href="/come">where to eat</a> and, on the days between nights out, what to do in <a href="/passeie">tours and wind sports</a>. To locate each place, open the <a href="/explore">map and beaches of Gostoso</a>. For general background on the town, the <a href="https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/S%C3%A3o_Miguel_do_Gostoso" rel="nofollow noopener">São Miguel do Gostoso page on Wikipedia</a> (in Portuguese) summarizes location and history.</p>

<h2 id="before-you-buy">Before you buy a ticket</h2>
<ul>
<li>Open the bio link of each party's profile and confirm date, start time and price. Batches change without notice.</li>
<li>Read what is included: drinks, food and shuttle vary a lot from one party to another.</li>
<li>Check the service fee. On Sympla, the fee is added to the ticket price.</li>
<li>Keep the cancellation and name-change policy.</li>
<li>Plan the ride back to your pousada before you go out, because most parties end in the early hours.</li>
<li>For a barefoot party on the sand, bring comfortable footwear.</li>
</ul>
<p>Vive Gostoso does not sell tickets and does not organize any of these parties. The links go to each party's official channel, and the information comes from what the organizers published.</p>

<h2 id="faq">Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Which New Year's Eve parties already have a program in São Miguel do Gostoso for 2027?</h3>
<p>Four: Amy Gostoso, Aqui Se Faz Gostoso, Réveillon da Praia and Réveillon Solarium. All of them include the night of December 31, 2026, and Aqui Se Faz Gostoso also has January 2 and 3.</p>
<h3>How much is the Réveillon Solarium ticket?</h3>
<p>On Sympla, R$ 360.00 plus a R$ 36.00 fee for the single ticket. The table for 2 costs R$ 820.00 plus an R$ 82.00 fee and the table for 4 costs R$ 1,640.00 plus a R$ 164.00 fee. Sales run until 12/29/2026.</p>
<h3>Which New Year's Eve in Gostoso has an open bar?</h3>
<p>Amy Gostoso announces open bar and open food. Aqui Se Faz Gostoso has a premium open bar on the night of December 31, and the other two nights sell drinks separately.</p>
<h3>Can I bring my own drinks?</h3>
<p>At Réveillon Solarium, yes: the event announces cooler allowed and no corkage fee. At the other parties, confirm with the organizers before buying.</p>
<h3>Do I need a transfer to get to the party?</h3>
<p>Amy Gostoso offers an exclusive, optional shuttle leaving from Rua da Xêpa. For the other parties, arrange transport with your pousada or book a <a href="/transfer">transfer</a> in advance.</p>
<h3>Until when can I buy tickets?</h3>
<p>Solarium sells until 12/29/2026. Réveillon da Praia sells in batches, and the last batch we read ran until 11/10 or until sold out. For the others, check the sales page.</p>

